+    # their not-yet-allocated part needs free space. Credit ONLY a regular file (no symlink) that carries an ownership
+    # marker and lives on the SAME filesystem as the CDATA directory measured here; anything else is credited 0. The
+    # budget admit below still refuses a file whose marker is not this reservation's.
+    credit() {   # credit FILE DECLARED_BYTES -> allocated bytes to subtract (<= DECLARED_BYTES)
